{
  "scene_id": "thora_b0_recruitment",
  "start_node": "n1",
  "nodes": {
    "n1": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(You meet Thora because she is carrying someone else's groceries.)",
      "next": "n2"
    },
    "n2": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Not metaphorically. A Gatekin family from two streets over is arguing with a broken cart while a tall orc-kin woman has already stacked every bag across both arms.)",
      "next": "n3"
    },
    "n3": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Which building?”",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    "n4": {
      "speaker": "gatekin parent",
      "text": "“We can manage.”",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    "n5": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“I did not ask if you could.”",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    "n6": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She notices you looking.)",
      "next": "n7"
    },
    "n7": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“You. Strong back?”",
      "next": "n8"
    },
    "n8": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Sometimes.”",
      "next": "n9"
    },
    "n9": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Good. Take the flour.”",
      "next": "n10"
    },
    "n10": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I was actually—”",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    "n11": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Flour.”",
      "next": "n12"
    },
    "n12": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(You take the flour.)",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    "n13": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Twenty minutes later, somehow, she is standing in your kitchen.)",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    "n14": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“How did this happen?”",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    "n15": {
      "speaker": "kess",
      "text": "“She followed the flour.”",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    "n16": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“This pantry is a disgrace.”",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    "n17": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You don't live here.”",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    "n18": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Clearly.”",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    "n19": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She removes a can with no label, shakes it once, and looks personally betrayed.)",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    "n20": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“What is this?”",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    "n21": {
      "speaker": "kess",
      "text": "“Emergency dinner.”",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    "n22": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n23"
    },
    "n23": {
      "speaker": "kess",
      "text": "“No?”",
      "next": "n24"
    },
    "n24": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n25"
    },
    "n25": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(The can goes into a bin.)",
      "next": "n26"
    },
    "n26": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Sit.”",
      "next": "n27"
    },
    "n27": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Why?”",
      "next": "n28"
    },
    "n28": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“You have gate ash on your collar and have not eaten.”",
      "next": "n29"
    },
    "n29": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“How do you know?”",
      "next": "n30"
    },
    "n30": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“You smell like burned stone and bad decisions.”",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    "n31": {
      "speaker": "kess",
      "text": "“She'll fit in.”",
      "next": "n32"
    },
    "n32": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Thora is already tying back her hair.)",
      "next": "n33"
    },
    "n33": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Faelen. Knife.”",
      "next": "n34"
    },
    "n34": {
      "speaker": "faelen",
      "text": "“Which one?”",
      "next": "n35"
    },
    "n35": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“The sharp one.”",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    "n36": {
      "speaker": "faelen",
      "text": "“All of them are sharp.”",
      "next": "n37"
    },
    "n37": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "(Looks at you.) “At least someone here has standards.”",
      "next": "n38"
    },
    "n38": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You still don't live here.”",
      "next": "n39"
    },
    "n39": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“We'll discuss rent after soup.”",
      "next": "n40"
    },
    "n40": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“That's not how tenancy works.”",
      "next": "n41"
    },
    "n41": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "(From the doorway, arriving for an inspection.) “For once, the landlord is correct.”",
      "next": "n42"
    },
    "n42": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“You look hungry too.”",
      "next": "n43"
    },
    "n43": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I am not staying.”",
      "next": "n44"
    },
    "n44": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Dana stays.)",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    "n45": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Dinner becomes six bowls, then seven when Momo appears at the stairwell.)",
      "next": "n46"
    },
    "n46": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Sit, little shadow.”",
      "next": "n47"
    },
    "n47": {
      "speaker": "momo",
      "text": "“I'm not very hungry.”",
      "next": "n48"
    },
    "n48": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“That is a statement about quantity, not attendance.”",
      "next": "n49"
    },
    "n49": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Momo sits.)",
      "next": "n50"
    },
    "n50": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Where are you staying?”",
      "next": "n51"
    },
    "n51": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Here and there.”",
      "next": "n52"
    },
    "n52": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Tonight?”",
      "next": "n53"
    },
    "n53": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“There is a bench at the transit hall.”",
      "next": "n54"
    },
    "n54": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n55"
    },
    "n55": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“No?”",
      "next": "n56"
    },
    "n56": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“We have a room.”",
      "next": "n57"
    },
    "n57": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“You have a room you cannot afford to furnish.”",
      "next": "n58"
    },
    "n58": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You saw the upstairs?”",
      "next": "n59"
    },
    "n59": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Your second-floor railing is loose.”",
      "next": "n60"
    },
    "n60": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“When did you—”",
      "next": "n61"
    },
    "n61": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“And the back window does not seal.”",
      "next": "n62"
    },
    "n62": {
      "speaker": "faelen",
      "text": "“She is correct.”",
      "next": "n63"
    },
    "n63": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Do not encourage her.”",
      "next": "n64"
    },
    "n64": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“I can pay rent.”",
      "next": "n65"
    },
    "n65": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You don't have to earn dinner first.”",
      "next": "n66"
    },
    "n66": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“I know.”",
      "next": "n67"
    },
    "n67": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She says it too quickly.)",
      "next": "n68"
    },
    "n68": {
      "speaker": "thora",
      "text": "“Now. Who wants seconds?”",
      "next": "n69"
    },
    "n69": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(By midnight, the pantry is labeled.)",
      "next": "n70"
    },
    "n70": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(By morning, the loose railing is fixed.)",
      "next": "n71"
    },
    "n71": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Thora has taken the smallest available room.)",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "end": {
      "end_scene": true
    }
  }
}
